{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of umbrella tricks to ascend to the moon in this\u00a0physics-based Metroidvania.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics-Based Platforming</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive movement designed with speedrunning in mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ways to approach platforming challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433800/extras/d7eab57ab676a00235b23fa6883e01ec.poster.avif?t=1764074055\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433800/extras/d7eab57ab676a00235b23fa6883e01ec.webm?t=1764074055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433800/extras/d7eab57ab676a00235b23fa6883e01ec.mp4?t=1764074055\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Umbrella</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jab the umbrella tip into terrain to vault over obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the canopy to slow your fall and float long distances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hook onto ledges, vines and more with the handle to climb high and gain speed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find replacement parts for your umbrella to unlock new movement options and locations.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An Interconnected World</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a planet abandoned by humans as a lone robot left behind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crumbling buildings, dark caves, waterfalls and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue the dying sunflower from its permanent shade.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and collect a variety of flowers throughout the world.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433800?t=1764074055","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433800/614049583337104b4463f70ae02e16fc9a7707e3/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764074055","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433800/af985cb4e888bc310d9b3adace3f75ff5b31b8da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764074055","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433800/af985cb4e888bc310d9b3adace3f75ff5b31b8da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764074055","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of umbrella tricks to ascend to the moon in this\u00a0physics-based Metroidvania.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics-Based Platforming</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expressive movement designed with speedrunning in mind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ways to approach platforming challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433800/extras/d7eab57ab676a00235b23fa6883e01ec.poster.avif?t=1764074055\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433800/extras/d7eab57ab676a00235b23fa6883e01ec.webm?t=1764074055\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src